  "content": "# Lux V1 光影包\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patreon.com/techthedev\"><img src=\"https://intellitonic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"300\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://discord.gg/eZ6GpXQXGC\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/853294489636831242?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=ffffff&color=5865f2&link=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FuBhFaBG\" style=\"height: 50px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://twitter.com/TheRealTechDev\"><img alt=\"X（原推特）关注\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/TheRealTechDev?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=black&labelColor=white&color=%23101013\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/lux-shaders\"><img alt=\"CurseForge下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/863609?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=%23f16436&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/lux-v1\"><img alt=\"Modrinth下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/DiGQENDV?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=%2316a869&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n![Imgur](https://imgur.com/p2kIQGi.jpg)\n\nLux 是一款基于 [Capt Tatsu's BSL Shaders](https://bitslablab.com \"Takes you to the BSL Website\") 的高保真 Minecraft Java 版光影包。\n\n默认设置下，Lux 主要面向中高端用户，但同时提供了丰富的自定义选项让您打造专属视觉体验。在追求硬件兼容性、美学表现与游戏实用性的同时，Lux 还融入了诸多实验性创新功能。虽然作为新生光影仍在频繁更新，但其采用的现代渲染技术能呈现令人惊艳的画面效果，绝对值得您体验。\n\n## 问题反馈\n\n如遇任何问题，请使用 [GitHub 问题追踪系统](https://github.com/TechDevOnGitHub/Lux-Shader/issues) 提交报告。",
